## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Hi Kevin,\n\nThank you for your inquiry, and nice to meet you! Portable blender cups are one of our best-selling items for Amazon sellers, and we'd be glad to support Brightline Home on this order.\n\nHere's how we can meet your requirements:\n\n1. Certification & Safety\n- FCC: Our portable blender [model no.] is FCC certified (Part 15B). We can send you the test report for review.\n- BPA Free: The cup body is made of [Tritan / food-grade PP], BPA free, with an [FDA / LFGB] food-contact test report available.\n- For Amazon compliance, we can also provide the UN38.3 report and MSDS for the lithium battery, which you'll need for FBA and shipping.\n\n2. Custom Logo\nWe offer [silk-screen printing / laser engraving] on the cup body or base. Please send your logo in AI or PDF format, and we'll send you a digital mockup within 24 hours for approval.\n\n3. Lead Time\nFor 2,000 units with your logo, our production time is about [XX] days after sample/artwork approval and deposit. Shipment within 25 days is [achievable / possible if we confirm the artwork and deposit by (date)]. We'll reserve a production slot for you once the details are confirmed.\n\n4. Price\nFor 2,000 units with a one-color logo and our standard packaging, our best price is USD [X.XX]/unit FOB [Shenzhen / Ningbo]. [If your price is below cost, add a line like this: To get closer to your USD 5.20 target, we can use (simplified packaging / a standard color / a slightly larger quantity).]\n\nTo finalize the quote, could you please confirm:\n- Capacity and color preference (we have [350ml / 380ml / 500ml] in [colors])\n- Packaging: standard box or custom-printed color box?\n- Do you need FBA labeling (FNSKU stickers, carton labels)? We can do this for free.\n- Your preferred FOB port\n\nWe can also send you a sample [within X days] so you can check the quality before you place the order.\n\nLooking forward to your reply and to working with you!\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Company Name]\n[WhatsApp / WeChat / Email]"
}
